				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2000367); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2000367&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607418004" alt="WrongJohnSilver" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2000367)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2000367); return false;" >WrongJohnSilver</a></span> <span class="odate time_1477359815 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">25 Oct 2016 01:43</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2676756">
									

<p>This is a long time in coming, and something I resurrected from the depths of my sandbox. The original idea of a phone call from a berating mother came from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nexescore" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2228610); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2228610&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1477360183" alt="Nexescore" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2228610)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nexescore" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2228610); return false;">Nexescore</a></span>. The original concept didn't work, but I saw potential and asked to revamp it. I did, but I was ultimately unsatisfied. I waited&#8230; and waited&#8230; and a whole year later, I figured out how I want the story to finish.</p>
<p>Yes, I'm going way old-school with my interpretation of D-class, but I don't care.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/twistedgears" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735681); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735681&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1477360183" alt="TwistedGears" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735681)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/twistedgears" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735681); return false;">TwistedGears</a></span> who reviewed this a year ago and convinced me it wasn't ready, then (you're right, it wasn't), and to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2303803); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2303803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1477360183" alt="Cyantreuse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2303803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2303803); return false;">Cyantreuse</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/spookybee" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1953164); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1953164&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1477360183" alt="SpookyBee" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1953164)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/spookybee" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1953164); return false;">SpookyBee</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gibberingeloquence" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1421648); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1421648&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1477360183" alt="GibberingEloquence" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1421648)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gibberingeloquence" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1421648); return false;">GibberingEloquence</a></span> for the modern review.</p>
<p>First photo is mine, second from <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Contrast_enhanced_meningioma.jpg" target="_blank">Wikipedia</a> and is public domain.</p>

